  + current Cargo.lock contains no jsonschema and proves no activation

& [FeatureTopology] remains closed
  + cantor_procedure_tool default is empty
  + existing json-schema enables schemars generation only
  + proposed schema-conformance enables json-schema and dep:jsonschema
  + schema-conformance is non-default and tool-local
  + no other crate gains a dependency or feature edge

& [ExactSourceTouch] after a future signature is four surfaces
  + modify C:\Project\Cantor\Cargo.toml
  + modify C:\Project\Cantor\Cargo.lock
  + modify C:\Project\Cantor\crates\cantor_procedure_tool\Cargo.toml
  + add C:\Project\Cantor\crates\cantor_procedure_tool\tests\schema_validator_dependency.rs
  - never: lib.rs reader_observation.rs CLI MCP service ecosystem preflight schemas golden provider model persistence effect hardware or FPGA source

& [FocusedProbe] is cpms_i03a_schema_validator_dependency
  + it is private integration-test evidence gated by schema-conformance
  + resources are compile-time constants or the five exact checked-in I02 canonical documents
  + exact bytes length and SHA256 are observed before UTF-8 or JSON interpretation
  + test code performs no runtime filesystem read and writes no artifact

& [ValidatorConfiguration] is explicit
  + jsonschema 0.49.2
  + Draft::Draft202012
  + should_validate_formats false
  + should_ignore_unknown_formats true
  + zero custom formats
  + with_retriever ProbeDenyRetriever
  + no implicit default may substitute for any field

& [InterfaceTruth] distinguishes interface from capability
  + ValidationOptions always owns a retriever interface and normally contains DefaultRetriever
  + default-features false removes default external transports but not the interface
  + no-resolution means admitted targets cannot cause external acquisition and every sentinel invocation refuses

& [ReferencePreflight] is primary policy before validator construction
  + recursively inspect every reference-bearing schema keyword within finite limits
  + treat the exact root Draft 2020-12 dialect declaration as configuration identity rather than retrieval
  + treat dollar id as identity and never retrieval permission
  + admit dollar ref only when a valid pointer or anchor fragment resolves inside the same parsed document
  + refuse HTTP HTTPS file relative UNC drive-letter data opaque unknown-scheme empty missing malformed escaping dynamic and over-limit targets
  + record keyword location raw target digest target class resolved location disposition and rule identity

& [ProbeDenyRetriever] is zero capability
  + a zero-sized test-local type implements jsonschema::Retrieve
  + every retrieve call returns a deterministic owned denial error
  + it reads and writes no filesystem network environment registry cache database provider model subprocess persistence notification or device state
  + it owns no registry callback fallback mutable state or resource map
  + any invocation is internal_fault because preflight should have made retrieval unreachable

& [ProductionOwnership] is separate
  + I03D later owns CantorDenyRetriever in reader_observation.rs
  + I03A neither implements nor exports production retrieval or validation behavior
  + a shared contract shape does not merge source ownership authority or phase gates

& [MetaAndConstruction] are honest
  + explicit Draft 2020-12 meta validation yields MetaSchemaObservation
  + public validator construction occurs only after accepted preflight and meta disposition
  + public construction repeats internal schema validation
  + crate-private without_schema_validation is forbidden
  + meta and construction results are distinct report fields but not falsely described as operationally disjoint engine passes

& [ReferenceProof] is adversarial
  + local pointer and anchor success
  + external relative UNC drive file HTTP HTTPS data opaque unknown missing malformed escaping dynamic and boundary failures
  + zero retriever invocation on every accepted or refused case
  + a direct sentinel unit observation proves deterministic denial without treating invocation as successful conformance

& [NumericAndResourceProof] retains the original candidate obligations
  + exact u64 maximum and maximum plus one behavior
  + no f64 conversion as mathematical oracle
  + at most 8 schemas 4194304 bytes each 256 definitions 4096 references and depth 64
  + at most 32 instances 1048576 bytes each depth 128 and 256 findings
  + checked arithmetic governs every byte count depth count span and diagnostic limit

& [Determinism] compares stable identity only
  + booleans counts normalized rule identities digests and ordered projections repeat exactly
  + engine display strings source-chain text allocation addresses and incidental iteration order are excluded

& [DependencyAndHostGates] remain atomic
  + exact feature tree under locked offline resolution
  + focused debug and release tests have independent commands and exit states
  + full default and all-feature workspace debug release format lint docs advisory and evidence gates follow
  + Windows application-control bypass exclusion elevation or executable substitution is forbidden
  + Enterprise signing denial remains a blocker until independently closed

& [ActivationRule] requires every Revision 1 requirement verified against one exact diff and lock
  + any package feature API preflight retriever format numeric resource host audit evidence or source-touch fault refuses activation
  + activation requires separate completion review satisfaction signature and active phase lock
  + partial observations grant no authority

& [AuthorityLimit] is I03A optional dependency and focused test only after a future signature
  - never: untrusted parsing validation corpus comparison compatibility admission provider model service persistence network effect production hardware FPGA or shared inference

& [Disposition] is canonical_revision_candidate_formed_activation_refused
